a-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runsat\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Runs At</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(does not run)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.24.95dcf3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">March 17, 2026<br/>Targuna Update</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260317210145&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pirate_Cook_548d9f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a pirate cook.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Munch munch...</li><li>Ooooops!</li><li>YUMMYYY!</li><li>DELICIOUS!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Pirates are the crime lords of the sea, always seeking to claim the wealth of others. Every ship requires a loyal crew, usually consisting of former sailors, escaped prisoners and treasure hunters alike. Each member has a specific role ensuring the ship remains functional and prepared for battle, even during the harshest conditions on the open sea.<br/><br/>\nPirate cooks are often inexperienced deckhands or low-ranking sailors seeking new adventures at sea. Food aboard a pirate ship can become scarce and cooks are known to hide sought-after rations from others to avoid hunger themselves. Despite their title, the cook commonly had to perform amputations after battle when no real surgeon is available. This task earned them the feared nickname \"sea butcher\". Their experience with blades makes them surprisingly capable fighters in close combat.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Upon dying, there is a chance it will say one of the phrases below and drop one of the corresponding foods:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050713135144&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=0\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cheese_fd71d6.gif\"/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">Five-second rule!</span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150418081224&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=0\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\"/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">Well, great! Now it's all sandy...</span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"latest?cb=20051003131618&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=0\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\"/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">That was for tomorrow's stew!</span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060803020734&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=0\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orange_588bb0.gif\"/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Orange</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">The captain said I needed that!</span></li>\n<li><img alt=\"latest?cb=20081210153433&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=0\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Roll_24048e.gif\"/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">Nooo! That was freshly baked!</span></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-f